    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>spatial-predicate-join-left-rings · 1×1×1 workgroups × 128×1×1 lanes = 128 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-spatial-predicate-join-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 128\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-spatial-predicate-join-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"128\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"4\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACAAAAAECAMAAADYmc3mAAAABlBMVEVfZnLZ2dmiVvOOAAAAj0lEQVR4AQGEAHv/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAQEBAeMAG/rm4dUAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>128 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const featureOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; featureOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const polygonOffsetsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; polygonOffsets: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const featureRingsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; featureRings: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const POLYGON_COUNT: u32 = 102u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">const RING_COUNT: u32 = 102u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"14\">@compute @workgroup_size(128)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"15\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">  _ = &amp;featureOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">  _ = &amp;polygonOffsets;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">  _ = &amp;featureRings;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 33554432u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 128u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  let polygonStart = featureOffsets[featureOffsetsOffset + index];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  let polygonEnd = featureOffsets[featureOffsetsOffset + index + 1u];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  var ringStart = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  var ringEnd = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  if (polygonStart &lt;= polygonEnd &amp;&amp; polygonEnd &lt;= POLYGON_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">    let first = polygonOffsets[polygonOffsetsOffset + polygonStart];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">    let last = polygonOffsets[polygonOffsetsOffset + polygonEnd];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">    if (first &lt;= last &amp;&amp; last &lt;= RING_COUNT) { ringStart = first; ringEnd = last; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  featureRings[featureRingsOffset + index * 2u] = ringStart;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  featureRings[featureRingsOffset + index * 2u + 1u] = ringEnd;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>featureOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"parks-feature-offsets\">parks-feature-offsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>polygonOffsets<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"parks-polygon-offsets\">parks-polygon-offsets</td><td>read</td><td>u32</td></tr><tr><td>featureRings<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"spatial-predicate-join-left-feature-rings\">spatial-predicate-join-left-feature-rings</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUSpatialPredicateJoin/feature-rings · main · f33013d0</figcaption></figure></section>",
